    "Description": "Built an open JSON Schema for defining AI agent teams.\u003Cp\u003EMulti-agent systems are becoming a real deployment pattern \u2014 not single assistants, but teams with roles, handoffs, and human checkpoints. But there\u0026#x27;s no shared way to define one that travels across frameworks. Every implementation is scattered, locked to whichever tool you picked first. Built the schema to fix that.\u003Cp\u003EThe schema lives at schema.openenvelope.org and is registered in SchemaStore, so if you drop a .envelope.json file in",
